take my armor off first (I never polymorph) and blasted my SDSM, shirt,
robe etc. I had had put on the HOAA earlier to get out of Gehennom (got
kicked back like 40 times, couldn't stand it any more. Wished for the helm
since I figured it would help out in the end also.) so  my AC was now -8
for the rest of the game. Sweet.

I found the portal and whacked all the E's and H's pretty easily. Switched
to =of Lev and =oSearching for air and managed to run around and tackle
