-Found Grayswadir and Frostbrand in a bones pile from a priest I had
thought had a good shot. The Knight made much better use of them.
-Cast a lot of spells, Knight was a pretty good performer in this area. By
the end of the game I was maxed on all spellcasting slots..
-Managed to not get too bogged down as I have with ofher caracters. As
always, sloppy bookeeping resulted in various items being lost, forgotten
and
blow away. Where'd that SOR go? Oh well...
-Didn't geoncide L since I had Sunsword and could #turn. They weren't too
