-Blew Vlad and a Minotaur away with one MagicMissle cast. Sweet.
-As always, ascended and realized many items had disappeared during the
endgame. I don't know how they get lost but I typically loose 50% of my
rings/items on the Astral Plane.
-No genocides, but plenty of reverse genocides. Lot's of wraiths and Silver
dragons to swap my mail out.


